-- HOLE F SCRIPT AW STYLE -------------------------------- main.franco.kl  K1612

El hole di f makan byeshtaghal ka code: attribute `on*`, aw attribute `style`, aw gowa `<script>` aw `<style>`. W mafeesh escape yekhalli el qeema amna henak.

3│     khali page = html"""<script>{name}</script>"""
                                    ^^^^

Mosa3da: Ba3at el data lel scripts b `{ json(x) }` gowa `<script type="application/json">`, w ekhtar el styles b class badal hole f style.

